## Summary
16 workers and citizens staged a sit-in protest in the lobby of Sejong Hotel demanding reinstatement, and they have been mass-transferred to prosecution, indicating legal action against the protesters.

## Key Points
- The protest occurred in the lobby of Sejong Hotel.
- Protesters were demanding reinstatement, likely related to employment issues.
- A total of 16 individuals were involved in the sit-in.
- They have been transferred to prosecution en masse, suggesting legal consequences.
- This event highlights labor disputes and the legal response to protests.


